Subject: 'if' statement conditional on indexed value of a constant
Message-ID: <q1fcmeMupAw.32ZboQRsBwAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/nimble-users/c/q1fcmeMupAw/m/32ZboQRsBwAJ>
